cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Metamaterials PINN: physics-informed neural networks for surface plasmon polaritons on metamaterials"
abstract: >-
  Physics-informed neural networks that solve the frequency-domain Maxwell
  equations for surface plasmon polaritons at metamaterial interfaces, with
  every physics routine benchmarked against closed-form, literature or
  transfer-matrix references. Includes an effective-medium treatment of
  metal/dielectric multilayers, a transfer-matrix solver, differentiable
  inverse design, and a study quantifying where homogenisation of the
  multilayer breaks down.
type: software
